Bizzlo Country Desk Guide Pack

This downloadable working pack covers destination notes for the United Kingdom,
Ireland, United States, Germany, Australia, New Zealand, Canada, and Dubai.

Counselor workflow:
- Confirm destination fit, intake, budget, and academic profile.
- Collect passport, academics, English test, SOP, LOR, CV, and finance proof.
- Shortlist only partner-linked programmes in Bizzlo Course Finder.
- Move the file to Videshway admin review before university submission.

Replace this working pack with the final designed PDF before external rollout.
